        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** IMMACULATE 2 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM MID-TERRACE HOME WITH BACK GARDEN *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this immaculate two-bedroom, one-bathroom mid-terrace home to the rental market, ideally located in the popular Liffey Place development, Liffey Park, Lucan, Co. Dublin.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and spacious property offers well-proportioned living accommodation and a private back garden. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a modern fully fitted kitchen with ample storage, two generous double bedrooms, and a stylish main bathroom.\nThe property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in excellent condition, offering comfortable and modern living in a well-established residential location. The private back garden provides an excellent outdoor space, ideal for relaxing or entertaining.\nLiffey Place is ideally situated within easy reach of Lucan Village and offers convenient access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, parks, and leisure facilities. The area is well served by public transport, while the M50, N4, and major road networks are easily accessible, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas straightforward.\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a beautifully presented two-bedroom home with a private back garden in a popular residential development in Lucan. Early interest is highly recommended.\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Immaculate 2 Bed / 1 Bath mid-terrace home</li>\n <li>Bright and spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Two generous double bedrooms</li>\n <li>Modern fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Stylish main bathroom</li>\n <li>Private back garden</li>\n <li>Excellent condition throughout</li>\n <li>Popular residential location</li>\n <li>Close to Lucan Village and a host of local amenities</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\n <li>Easy access to the M50, N4, and Dublin City Centre</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
